          <div class="comment-item"><span class="comment-dot" style="background:#E87722"></span><span>Biggest overs vs budget: <b>Taxes +$324K</b>, Credit Card +$544K (unbudgeted), General +$100K. Biggest savings: Paid Media −$303K, Software &amp; Tools −$225K, Payroll −$411K.</span></div>
          <div class="comment-item"><span class="comment-dot" style="background:#94a3b8"></span><span><b>Net Increase in Cash +$290K</b> after −$265K of other financing / non-operating outflows.</span></div>
