<div class="board-slide">
  <div class="slide-header">
    <div class="sh-title">Cash recovery consolidates — Net CF turned positive in Q2 2026 (+$405K) after five straight quarters of decline</div>
    <div class="sh-right">
      <div class="sh-period">Cash Balance &amp; Net CF · Quarterly Q1'25–Q2'26</div>
      <div class="sh-num">06 / 06</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="slide-body" style="gap:8px">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;height:380px;overflow:hidden">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;overflow:hidden;height:100%">
