        </div>
        <div class="comments-box" style="margin-top:2px">
          <div class="comment-item" style="font-size:10px"><span class="comment-dot" style="background:#14b8a6"></span><span>Q2'26 closes at <b>$4,502K</b>, <b>+$2,535K above budget ($1,967K, +128.9%)</b>. Highest quarter-end balance since Q1'25.</span></div>
          <div class="comment-item" style="font-size:10px"><span class="comment-dot" style="background:#E87722"></span><span><b>Steady decline from Q1'25 ($5,434K) to Q1'26 ($4,097K)</b> — five straight quarters of net cash burn — reversing in Q2'26 (+$405K).</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;overflow:hidden;height:100%">
        <div class="sec-label">Net CF QoQ — Quarterly Q1 2025–Q2 2026 ($K)</div>
        <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:195px;width:100%"><canvas id="bd-burn" width="420" height="185"></canvas></div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px">
          <span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:8.5px;color:#64748b"><span style="width:8px;height:8px;background:#1D9E75;border-radius:2px;display:inline-block"></span>Net accumulation</span>
          <span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:8.5px;color:#64748b"><span style="width:8px;height:8px;background:#E87722;border-radius:2px;display:inline-block"></span>Net burn</span>
