          <div class="comment-item" style="font-size:10px"><span class="comment-dot" style="background:#E87722"></span><span><b>Five consecutive quarters of cash burn</b>: Q1'25 −$541K → Q2'25 −$348K → Q3'25 −$275K → Q4'25 −$588K → Q1'26 −$126K.</span></div>
          <div class="comment-item" style="font-size:10px"><span class="comment-dot" style="background:#1D9E75"></span><span><b>Q2'26 Net CF: +$405K</b>, the first positive quarter since Q1'25 — reflecting the operational cash generation captured in Slide 5.</span></div>
